lucose: a randomised controlled trial. <source>Lancet</source><volume>368</volume>:<fpage>1096</fpage>&#x02013;1105, <year>2006</year><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">16997664</pub-id></mixed-citation></ref><ref id="r16"><label>16</label><mixed-citation publication-type="journal">Ramachandran A, Snehalatha C, Mary S, Mukesh B, Bhaskar AD, Vijay V: The Indian Diabetes Prevention Programme shows that lifestyle modification and metformin prevent type 2 diabetes in Asian Indian subjects with impaired glucose tolerance (IDPP-1). <source>Diabetologia</source><volume>49</volume>:<fpage>289</fpage>&#x02013;297, <year>2006</year><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">16391903</pub-id></mixed-citation></ref><ref id="r17"><label>17</label><mixed-citation publication-type="journal">Johnson SL, Tabaei BP, Herman WH: The efficacy and cost of alternative strategies for systematic screening for type 2 diabetes in the U.S. population 45&#x02013;74 years of age. <source>Diabetes Care</source><volume>28</volume>:<fpage>307</fpage>&#x02013;311, <year>2005</year><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">15677784</pub-id></mixed-citation></ref><ref id="r18"><label>18</label><mixed-citation publication-type="journal">Harris R, Donahue K, Rathore SS, Frame P, Woolf SH, Lohr KN: Screening adults for type 2 diabetes: a review of the evidence for the U.S. Preventive Services Task Force. <source>Ann Intern Med</source><volume>138</volume>:<fpage>215</fpage>&#x02013;229, <year>2003</year><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">12558362</pub-id></mixed-citation></ref><ref id="r19"><label>19</label><mixed-citation publication-type="journal">USPSTF: Screening for type 2 diabetes mellitus in adults: recommendations and rationale. <source>Ann Intern Med</source><volume>138</volume>:<fpage>212</fpage>&#x02013;214, <year>2003</year><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">12558361</pub-id></mixed-citation></ref><ref id="r20"><label>20</label><mixed-citation publication-type="journal">Dabelea D, Bell RA, D'Agostino RB Jr, Imperatore G, Johansen JM, Linder B, Li